  "repo_truth": "Two prior fresh reviews returned findings over earlier immutable subjects. The parent recorded remediations and now submits a 20-path subject that includes both prior dispatches and both remediation records. This dispatch states no conclusion about whether those findings are closed or whether the current subject is implementation-grade.",
